{"title":"2022 CEMC Gauss (Grade 8) Problems/Problem 6","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_8)_Problems/Problem_6&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>In the diagram, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/3/6/736f7ac3785ee739f497a1100f321db1481e1cac.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\angle ABC = 90^{\\circ}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"107\" height=\"15\" />.\n</p>\n<hr />\n<p><i>An image is supposed to go here.  You can help us out by creating one and <span class=\"plainlinks\"><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/index.php?title=2022_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_8)_Problems/Problem_6&amp;action=edit\">editing it in</a></span>.  Thanks.</i>\n</p>\n<hr />\n<p>What is the value of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" />?\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/5/e/65ed66241a868b5c589cd6ffdb88b0494938d8f8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A)}\\ 68 \\qquad\\textbf{(B)}\\ 23 \\qquad\\textbf{(C)}\\ 56 \\qquad\\textbf{(D)}\\ 28 \\qquad\\textbf{(E)}\\ 26$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"397\" height=\"18\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_8)_Problems/Problem_6&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>From the diagram, we see:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/8/3/083cbc68ec91f688f9d5f507db72a0831954c846.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x^{\\circ} + x^{\\circ} + 44^{\\circ} = 90^{\\circ}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"158\" height=\"16\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/7/5/9759ddecfcfa28d4a3cbbc7eede8b70fe23c55be.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2x^{\\circ} + 44^{\\circ} = 90^{\\circ}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"127\" height=\"16\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/5/e/75e50b22f8ad10a30070979b61a09b341e7479f9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2x^{\\circ} = 90^{\\circ} - 44^{\\circ} = 46^{\\circ}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"177\" height=\"16\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/0/8/d08d2c522d33a50e288d6e922212886291af24b8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x = \\frac{46}{2} = \\boxed{\\textbf {(B) } 23}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"147\" height=\"38\" />\n</p><p>~anabel.disher\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_8)_Problems/Problem_6&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_7)_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"2022 CEMC Gauss (Grade 7) Problems/Problem 6\">2022 CEMC Gauss (Grade 7) Problems/Problem 6</a></li></ul>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_8)\" title=\"2022 CEMC Gauss (Grade 8)\">2022 CEMC Gauss (Grade 8)</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_8)_Problems&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2022 CEMC Gauss (Grade 8) Problems 